[00:00.00] 
[00:00.50]Eins, zwei, drei, vier, fünf, sechs, sieben, acht
[00:10.50]Eins, zwei, drei, vier, fünf, sechs, sieben, acht
[00:21.10]I watch all day, lapping waves
[00:27.00]I don’t know my real name
[00:32.20]The world is just the same
[00:37.00]With a blessing, God says

[00:43.30]An empty hall inside me
[00:50.76]Echoes the only question
[00:54.45]Why I dreamed ’bout you?

[01:03.89]You look like me, indeed
[01:07.59]Back and forth
[01:09.11]You dance with me, indeed
[01:13.02]Left to right
[01:14.70]“Everyone shall kneel by their lily”
[01:19.94]“Everyone shall believe their sea”

[01:25.04]You sing for me, indeed
[01:28.76]Rise and fall
[01:30.61]You outlive me, I wish
[01:34.24]By all means
[01:35.78]At least I’ve chosen my way
[01:39.84]Dancing out of frame, of frame
[01:47.33] 
